    <section class="acnn-about-vision reveal" id="section1">
        <span class="orb o1"></span><span class="orb o2"></span>
        <span class="acnn-about-tag">Mission and Vision</span>
        <span class="acnn-about-quote">&ldquo;</span>
        <p>A future in which the ability to understand and control matter at the nanoscale leads to on-going revolutions in 21st century of technology and industry for its multifunctional applications in society. A world-leading research centre creating cutting-edge solutions to societal challenges. Our mission and our aims to contribute to the all about understanding and improving the human knowledge and skill with the tools of Nanoscience and Nanotechnology- A Science of small system.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="acnn-pts" id="section2">
        <span class="acnn-about-tag alt">Goals</span>
        <h2>Goals</h2>
        <ol>
            <li class="reveal"><span class="acnn-pt-no">1</span><p>To conduct Research &amp;Development activities to acquire frontiers knowledge in nanoscience and nanotechnology at international level and built awareness to society.</p></li>
            <li class="reveal"><span class="acnn-pt-no">2</span><p>To drive national strategies and policies for nanoscience and nanotechnology in ways that yield concrete and sustainable results.</p></li>
            <li class="reveal"><span class="acnn-pt-no">3</span><p>To transfer the knowledge and know-how in nanoscience and nanotechnology to the industrial sector while disseminating accurate information to the public,</p></li>
            <li class="reveal"><span class="acnn-pt-no">4</span><p>To undertake capacity building of human resource development in nanoscience and nanotechnology development,</p></li>
            <li class="reveal"><span class="acnn-pt-no">5</span><p>To develop infrastructure that would facilitate nanoscience and nanotechnology development.</p></li>
        </ol>
    </section>
    <section class="acnn-pts" id="section3">
        <span class="acnn-about-tag alt">Objectives</span>
        <h2>Objectives</h2>
        <ol>
            <li class="reveal"><span class="acnn-pt-no">1</span><p>Organizing State, National, and international level seminars and conferences related to nanoscience and Nanotechnology.</p></li>
            <li class="reveal"><span class="acnn-pt-no">2</span><p>Encouraging innovative and challenging technology/product/research based scientific projects.</p></li>
            <li class="reveal"><span class="acnn-pt-no">3</span><p>Publish scientific papers of in peer reviewed/Indexed journals.</p></li>
            <li class="reveal"><span class="acnn-pt-no">4</span><p>Generating patents/Protype in Nano Science and Technology</p></li>
            <li class="reveal"><span class="acnn-pt-no">5</span><p>Setting up of incubators for translational research (from laboratory to industry)</p></li>
            <li class="reveal"><span class="acnn-pt-no">6</span><p>Sensitizing public and media about the advantages, new finding and safeguards in Nano Science and Technology</p></li>
        </ol>
    </section>
    <section class="acnn-pts" id="section4">
        <span class="acnn-about-tag alt">Current scenario</span>
        <h2>Current scenario</h2>
        <ol>
            <li class="reveal"><span class="acnn-pt-no">1</span><p>To prepare new functional nanomaterial using green approach, waste resources and other Physical &amp; Chemical methods, studying their new science, new properties at nanoscale for its possible applications in industries, energy &amp; environment, and performance of human knowledge.</p></li>
            <li class="reveal"><span class="acnn-pt-no">2</span><p>To ensure all the major research areas of Nanoscience with major focus on agriculture, Magnetic materials, and purification of water, green energy source, Bio- nanomaterial for its applications in better health, energy &amp; environment sustainability.</p></li>
            <li class="reveal"><span class="acnn-pt-no">3</span><p>To focus on ancient Indian traditional Nano medicine and their different properties measurement as evidence-based medicine for it global acceptance.</p></li>
            <li class="reveal"><span class="acnn-pt-no">4</span><p>To dissemination of frontiers knowledge and inventions related to Nanoscience and nanotechnology in society/ academic institutions.</p></li>
            <li class="reveal"><span class="acnn-pt-no">5</span><p>To correlate and collaborate with different scientific research occurring in India and across the world.</p></li>
            <li class="reveal"><span class="acnn-pt-no">6</span><p>Support the development of Nanotechnology from discovery to production by start-ups, prototype and patent etc.</p></li>
        </ol>
    </section>
